model kplace
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): a place and a move keyed by persons, and two of its move instances stated same at their keys (tally 2.2, S-8: no longer two rows of an input); it loads clean; each fixture of codes/m0/edits.tsv changes one line"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons

place konto[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input amt: money PLN

input pay_day: date

def twice: money PLN = amt + amt

move pay[p in persons on pay_day]: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to konto[p] amount amt

ask q: twice

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 2026-01-01..
  persons + [ben] lives 2026-01-01..
  amt = 1.00 PLN "the card"
  pay_day = 2026-03-02 "the card"
  opening[konto[ana]] = 1.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[konto[ben]] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  same pay[ana] = pay[ben]
